# APEX Dashboard Placeholder

This directory is intentionally tracked for the historical top-level dashboard workspace.

The live APEX dashboard is generated during CI by `scripts/apex_dashboard_generator.py`.
The `dashboard_deploy` job in `.github/workflows/apex_performance.yml` writes the static
site to `_site/` and publishes that artifact through GitHub Pages.

Generated dashboard files are not committed here. The deployed dashboard is available at:

- `https://rc219805.github.io/Transformation_Portal/`
- `https://rc219805.github.io/Transformation_Portal/latest.html`

Keep this file in place unless the top-level `dashboard/` workspace is formally retired.
